%% title: A teacher's day in My routine
%% desc: The teacher sees a card for each of today's periods. If there is a study plan, they report the lesson as taught, partly taught or not taught. Choosing not taught asks for a reason. The next days sit below.
flowchart LR
  O["My routine<br/>today"]:::teacher --> C["Period card<br/>section · subject · room"]:::teacher
  C --> M{"What happened?"}:::note
  M -- "taught / partly" --> R["Reported"]:::teacher
  M -- "not taught" --> N["Give a reason"]:::teacher
  N --> R
  O --> X["Next days"]:::note
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
